cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Data and analysis code for "Virtual Reality as a Complementary Tool for Joint
  Attention Training in Autism: Evidence from a Randomized Controlled Study"
message: Please cite the article, and this archive if you use the data or code.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  De-identified participant-level data, analysis code, and result files
  underlying a randomized controlled trial of VR-based joint attention training
  in 43 school-aged boys with autism spectrum disorder. Trial registration
  IRCT20221224056907N1 (Iranian Registry of Clinical Trials); ethics approval
  IR.USWR.REC.1401.177.
